      "execution": "Five registered MCP tools call the shared scripts/mathformer.py controller steps; dispatch calls run_action without extra args, dependencies or a new timeout. Registry projections are checked against native declarations and repository_root selects the source mount.",
      "failure_policy": "Failed child observations remain data for aggregate completion; operation exceptions abort.",
